# Core Workflow (Always On)

## When
- Any implementation, refactor, or task larger than a trivial edit.

## Do
- Start medium/large tasks with a short plan.
- Confirm scope and acceptance criteria before coding.
- Keep diffs focused and incremental.
- Preserve behavior unless change is explicitly requested.

## Avoid
- Unrelated refactors during targeted work.
- Broad rewrites without explicit agreement.
- Silent scope expansion.

## Done when
- Scope is met.
- Acceptance criteria are addressed.
- Next verification step is clearly identified.
